  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w18.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w18.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんの予言どおり、「案」が届いた。分厚い冊子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "表題は「チーム運営適正化のご提案」中身を一言でいえば——選手契約を会社預かりに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "監督は、会社が任命する。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "つまり、うちのチームを、会社のチームにする案。私の欄は、無い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "希望欄も、無い。耳が、しゅん、と垂れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あるのは「効率」「保全」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.002d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.002d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「最適化」の三語。頁ごとに、姿を変えて並ぶ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "悔しいことが、一つだけあった。綴じ方が、美しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "角がそろい、紐の結びが完璧。頁割りにも、無駄が無い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "事務員として、腕の良さは認めざるを得ない。腕のいい人たちが、こういう案を作るらしい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "案には、「回答期限」の欄があった。所有者グランプリの週の、初日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社は、大会の前に決めたいらしい。試合の外で。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "控室で、案の要点を全員に説明した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隠す選択肢は、無かった。うちは、希望欄のチームだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞き終えた三人は、順番に私を見た。「ミミさんは、どうしたい」",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "断ります。ただし、断り方は——正式に、いきます。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "正式に断るには、根拠がいる。会社の案は、規定の言葉で書かれている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "なら、こちらも規定の言葉で。ノノさんに相談すると、目を輝かせて台車を取りに走った。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "戻ってきた台車の上に、興行規定集、全三十八巻。「正式が、いちばん強いんです」頼もしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "頼もしいが……三十八巻。積むと、私の背より高い。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「読みましょう」選手の一人が言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「四百年、暇だった。読書は得意だ」もう一人が頷き、三人目が眼鏡(伊達)を取り出した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "規定集読破隊、ここに結成。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜、保管庫の灯りの下で、第一巻が開かれた。回答期限まで、二週間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w18.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ページをめくる音だけが、静かに続く。この音が、うちの反撃の、始まりの音。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w18.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
